 striking force of the US Navy during the Pacific War from 1944 to 1945. An ideal composition for this kind of task force consisted of 3-4 aircraft carriers, 4-6  support vessels, cruisers or fast battleships and 18-24 destroyers. Fast Carrier Task Forces were used in all US Navy’s battles in the Pacific and usually 1-2 task groups were utilized in raids against island strong points in the Pacific such as Iwo Jima or Chichi Jima.","LocalizedString":"A Naval Task Force is a unit or formation that is assembled to work on a single task or mission. During WWII the US Navy alone created around 100 naval task forces. A Fast Carrier Task Force was a group formation used as the main striking force of the US Navy during the Pacific War from 1944 to 1945. An ideal composition for this kind of task force consisted of 3-4 aircraft carriers, 4-6  support vessels, cruisers or fast battleships and 18-24 destroyers. Fast Carrier Task Forces were used in all US Navy’s battles in the Pacific and usually 1-2 task groups were utilized in raids against island strong points in the Pacific such as Iwo Jima or Chichi Jima."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Common","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Expansion2019","isReserved":true,"chooseOneCards":[{"cardText":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_event_naval_task_force_choose1","SourceString":"Add a NAVAL BOMBARDMENT to hand.","LocalizedString":"Add a NAVAL BOMBARDMENT to hand."},"selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":false},{"cardText":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_event_naval_task_force_choose2","SourceString":"Add a SUPPLY SHIPMENT to hand.","LocalizedString":"Add a SUPPLY SHIPMENT to hand."},"selectTargetOnPlayedFromHand":false}],"spawnCardName":"card_event_naval_bombardment;card_event_supply_shipment","soundEnterPlay":{"ObjectName":"SoundWave'Naval_Support_17'","ObjectPath":"kards/Content/Assets/Audio/Misc/OrdersFeb17/Naval_Support_17.0"},"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/USA/t_us_destoyer.t_us_destoyer","SubPathString":""},"artist":"A